			"notes": "- Rewrote how buildings and rooms are stored in memory: the mod now tracks only block positions and entity references, reading actual data from the world on demand — significantly reducing memory usage for large buildings\n- Fixed a bug where adding or removing entities with the Construction Hammer was not working correctly\n- Paintings, item frames, and other hanging entities now correctly expand building bounds to include their attachment points, preventing data loss when saving or pushing\n- Editing performance improved: block and entity counts are now tracked incrementally during editing instead of being recalculated each time\n- Fixed potential desync issues between building data and the actual world state\n\n[Full Changelog](https://github.com/STRUTTURA/struttura-architect-spawner/compare/v0.0.8...v0.0.9)"
		},
