			"notes": "- Like button moved to top-center of the screen for better visibility\n- Private buildings are now properly handled: likes are disabled when entering a private building\n- Mobs placed inside a building now freeze immediately, preventing them from walking or falling away before the next tick\n- Dropped items on the ground are no longer accidentally saved as part of a building\n- Entities placed while in ADD mode are now auto-added to the building by proximity, making entity editing smoother and more reliable\n- Fixed an issue where some cloud downloads could fail due to missing authentication headers\n\n[Full Changelog](https://github.com/STRUTTURA/struttura-architect-spawner/compare/v0.0.7...v0.0.8)"
