			"notes": "- Same biome can now be assigned to multiple spawn rules, adding variety to how buildings appear in the same environment\n- Spawn rule is now picked randomly when multiple rules match the current biome\n- Improved over-water spawning: buildings near water now blend more naturally with the terrain, allowing blocks below the entrance to coexist with water\n- Paintings now rotate correctly when buildings are spawned with rotation\n- First push disclaimer now warns about site rules and includes a \"View Rules\" button to review them in-browser\n- GUI error messages now properly close the panel first, so you can always read the error in chat\n- Fixed an issue where some cloud requests could fail due to missing authentication\n\n[Full Changelog](https://github.com/STRUTTURA/struttura-architect-spawner/compare/v0.0.6...v0.0.7)"
