			"notes": "- New spawn area clearing mode: \"Above Entrance\" clears only blocks above the entrance anchor, preserving terrain below for more natural-looking spawns (bridges, archways, ground-level buildings)\n- In-game auto-update: when a new mod version is available, you'll get a prompt with one-click download & restart\n- Cloud access enforcement: if your mod version is too old, cloud features are disabled with a clear message explaining why you need to update\n- Spawn area clearing is now a three-option setting: None, All, or Above Entrance (previously just on/off)\n\n[Full Changelog](https://github.com/STRUTTURA/struttura-architect-spawner/compare/v0.0.5...v0.0.6)"
